// The grapple run's race course: twelve rings round a loop through a rock
// field, out from our ship's stern and back (the "Grapple run" scenario
// places it with its origin at the start ring, 17 m behind our stern, and
// sets the rocks). See docs/ships.md.
Design(
    name: "COURSE",
    hostile: false,
    model: None,
    shield: (center: (0.0, 0.0, 0.0), radii: (5.0, 5.0, 5.0)),
    turrets: [],
    modules: [(module: "course/rings")],
)
